1
00:00:17,120 --> 00:00:20,560
One, two, three, four.

2
00:00:21,080 --> 00:00:24,400
Five, six, seven, eight.

3
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:26,760
Two, two.

4
00:00:27,440 --> 00:00:27,800
Good.

5
00:00:28,120 --> 00:00:28,450
Turn.

6
00:00:31,560 --> 00:00:32,759
Bai Feixin, are you okay?

7
00:00:32,759 --> 00:00:33,920
Are you okay?

8
00:00:33,920 --> 00:00:34,600
I'm fine.

9
00:00:35,360 --> 00:00:36,290
Let's continue.

10
00:00:36,880 --> 00:00:38,960
We must practice until the director...

11
00:00:38,960 --> 00:00:39,360
No,

12
00:00:40,360 --> 00:00:42,290
until we are satisfied ourselves.

13
00:00:46,160 --> 00:00:47,320
It's getting late.

14
00:00:47,320 --> 00:00:48,480
Why don't you all go back first?

15
00:00:48,480 --> 00:00:49,080
Director,

16
00:00:49,880 --> 00:00:51,410
why don't you go back first?

17
00:00:51,560 --> 00:00:52,290
I want to stay

18
00:00:53,120 --> 00:00:54,450
and practice a bit more.

19
00:00:54,680 --> 00:00:56,720
I'll stay too.

20
00:00:57,560 --> 00:00:59,240
I'll stay too.

21
00:00:59,240 --> 00:01:00,200
We'll all stay.

22
00:01:00,920 --> 00:01:01,680
Good job.

23
00:01:02,680 --> 00:01:03,280
Director,

24
00:01:04,440 --> 00:01:05,880
Nothing else matters.

25
00:01:06,080 --> 00:01:07,480
Only rehearsal matters.

26
00:01:08,480 --> 00:01:10,200
As long as the green pines remain,

27
00:01:10,200 --> 00:01:11,530
we won't lack firewood.

28
00:01:12,720 --> 00:01:13,720
Let's do it again.

29
00:01:13,720 --> 00:01:14,320
Okay.

30
00:01:15,760 --> 00:01:19,080
Five, six, seven, eight.

31
00:01:21,039 --> 00:01:21,640
Director.

32
00:01:21,640 --> 00:01:23,240
Three, four,

33
00:01:23,280 --> 00:01:25,200
five, six.

34
00:01:30,160 --> 00:01:30,760
Wu,

35
00:01:30,960 --> 00:01:33,490
rehearsals are going ridiculously well now.

36
00:01:33,880 --> 00:01:36,210
Everything is finally on the right track.

37
00:01:36,520 --> 00:01:38,280
Tiaotiao's teacher even called me today

38
00:01:38,280 --> 00:01:40,610
to say Tiaotiao has more and more friends.

39
00:01:40,920 --> 00:01:43,580
Is this what it feels like when the worst is over?

40
00:01:45,039 --> 00:01:46,320
How are things on your end?

41
00:01:46,320 --> 00:01:48,050
Is everything going smoothly?

42
00:01:59,000 --> 00:02:00,060
What are you doing?

43
00:02:05,960 --> 00:02:07,290
I can't take it anymore.

44
00:02:07,720 --> 00:02:09,479
Everyone says they want to crowdfund an urn for Jinzi,

45
00:02:09,479 --> 00:02:11,440
and they've already started picking one out.

46
00:02:11,440 --> 00:02:13,040
This is getting out of hand.

47
00:02:13,560 --> 00:02:15,080
I need to tell everyone the truth.

48
00:02:15,080 --> 00:02:16,140
Didn't you say that

49
00:02:16,560 --> 00:02:17,760
ruthlessness is the mark of a truly great man?

50
00:02:17,760 --> 00:02:18,690
Calm down first.

51
00:02:19,240 --> 00:02:20,240
Think carefully.

52
00:02:20,240 --> 00:02:22,440
Isn't everything going well right now?

53
00:02:23,160 --> 00:02:23,720
But

54
00:02:24,160 --> 00:02:26,220
my conscience can't take it anymore.

55
00:02:26,560 --> 00:02:29,440
I have to tell everyone the truth about the pregnancy.

56
00:02:29,440 --> 00:02:30,920
Let's wait until the baby is born.

57
00:02:30,920 --> 00:02:32,120
Let's go back for now.

58
00:02:41,480 --> 00:02:43,440
I think we have one thing in common.

59
00:02:43,920 --> 00:02:45,640
We all like Jinxi.

60
00:02:46,960 --> 00:02:48,160
As members of the fan club,

61
00:02:48,160 --> 00:02:49,560
there is one thing I really appreciate about you.

62
00:02:49,560 --> 00:02:50,360
Do you know what it is?

63
00:02:50,360 --> 00:02:51,880
No idea.

64
00:02:51,880 --> 00:02:52,760
Unity.

65
00:02:53,840 --> 00:02:55,400
Speaking of unity,

66
00:02:56,320 --> 00:02:57,760
I'm surrounded by four people in the bottom lane.

67
00:02:57,760 --> 00:02:59,280
Can't you come and help me?

68
00:02:59,280 --> 00:03:00,560
Coming.

69
00:03:00,560 --> 00:03:01,160
Clearing minions.

70
00:03:01,160 --> 00:03:01,640
Clearing minions?

71
00:03:01,640 --> 00:03:02,720
My life is hanging by a thread!

72
00:03:02,720 --> 00:03:03,840
Are minions more important than my life?

73
00:03:03,840 --> 00:03:05,120
Where are the minions?

74
00:03:05,400 --> 00:03:07,530
What are you four doing in the top lane?

75
00:03:07,920 --> 00:03:08,720
Don't rush.

76
00:03:08,720 --> 00:03:09,120
Go.

77
00:03:09,120 --> 00:03:09,720
It's not what you think.

78
00:03:09,720 --> 00:03:10,400
Hurry up.

79
00:03:11,080 --> 00:03:13,200
Don't touch my red buff.

80
00:03:13,640 --> 00:03:14,160
Listen to me first.

81
00:03:14,160 --> 00:03:14,960
Hurry up.

82
00:03:15,560 --> 00:03:16,620
What are you doing?

83
00:03:16,680 --> 00:03:17,120
Speak.

84
00:03:17,600 --> 00:03:18,840
Tell me everything you know.

85
00:03:18,840 --> 00:03:19,100
I...

86
00:03:20,840 --> 00:03:22,240
Should I really tell you?

87
00:03:26,160 --> 00:03:28,440
I do have a crush

88
00:03:28,440 --> 00:03:30,040
on Director Ning's assistant.

89
00:03:30,040 --> 00:03:31,240
She's petite,

90
00:03:31,480 --> 00:03:32,720
fair-skinned,

91
00:03:33,040 --> 00:03:34,560
and has a really sweet smile.

92
00:03:34,560 --> 00:03:36,490
That's not what I'm talking about.

93
00:03:36,560 --> 00:03:37,420
Then what is it?

94
00:03:38,600 --> 00:03:39,800
You mean Xiaoqi, right?

95
00:03:39,800 --> 00:03:40,120
Yes.

96
00:03:40,120 --> 00:03:41,360
She is indeed very cute.

97
00:03:41,360 --> 00:03:43,160
We even talked about our dreams.

98
00:03:43,160 --> 00:03:44,760
Her dream is also to be a director.

99
00:03:44,760 --> 00:03:45,360
What I'm asking...

100
00:03:45,360 --> 00:03:46,840
I'm not asking about this.

101
00:03:46,920 --> 00:03:47,400
Tell me.

102
00:03:47,480 --> 00:03:48,880
Tell me everything you know.

103
00:03:48,880 --> 00:03:50,010
I really don't know.

104
00:03:56,040 --> 00:03:57,079
You just have a large frame.

105
00:03:57,079 --> 00:03:59,120
You can't tell if you gain a few pounds.

106
00:03:59,120 --> 00:04:00,840
What is it, Sister?

107
00:04:01,720 --> 00:04:02,680
You really don't know?

108
00:04:02,680 --> 00:04:03,960
I really don't know.

109
00:04:04,720 --> 00:04:05,320
Come here.

110
00:04:08,440 --> 00:04:09,300
Let me tell you.

111
00:04:09,760 --> 00:04:10,720
Pregnant?

112
00:04:11,120 --> 00:04:12,320
Keep your voice down.

113
00:04:14,440 --> 00:04:15,170
Are you sure?

114
00:04:15,400 --> 00:04:16,079
I'm sure.

115
00:04:16,079 --> 00:04:17,540
I heard it with my own ears.

116
00:04:18,120 --> 00:04:19,320
When did this happen?

117
00:04:19,760 --> 00:04:20,760
I had no idea.

118
00:04:21,160 --> 00:04:22,490
There was no sign at all.

119
00:04:24,240 --> 00:04:24,720
Right.

120
00:04:26,840 --> 00:04:29,120
Isn't Director Ning's cat sick?

121
00:04:29,560 --> 00:04:31,120
He often goes to the director's house

122
00:04:31,120 --> 00:04:33,120
in the middle of the night to take care of the cat,

123
00:04:33,120 --> 00:04:34,560
and he wouldn't let me tell you.

124
00:04:34,560 --> 00:04:35,000
So,

125
00:04:35,400 --> 00:04:37,600
he goes there in the middle of the night.

126
00:04:42,040 --> 00:04:42,900
Let me tell you.

127
00:04:43,120 --> 00:04:44,920
Only the two of us know about this.

128
00:04:44,920 --> 00:04:46,320
You must not tell anyone else.

129
00:04:46,320 --> 00:04:46,800
Got it?

130
00:04:47,320 --> 00:04:47,960
Swear.

131
00:04:49,960 --> 00:04:50,800
Swear an oath.

132
00:04:51,320 --> 00:04:52,200
I swear an oath.

133
00:04:52,840 --> 00:04:53,720
I,

134
00:04:54,000 --> 00:04:54,920
may I be struck by lightning

135
00:04:54,920 --> 00:04:55,320
if I tell anyone.

136
00:04:55,320 --> 00:04:56,800
Just keep your voice down.

137
00:05:00,320 --> 00:05:02,050
What should we do next, Sister?

138
00:05:09,920 --> 00:05:12,160
Jinxi, could you share with our listeners

139
00:05:12,160 --> 00:05:14,880
what your rehearsal schedule is like?

140
00:05:15,040 --> 00:05:17,640
I wake up at 6:00,

141
00:05:17,640 --> 00:05:19,480
then I go for a run at 6:15,

142
00:05:19,640 --> 00:05:22,480
come back at 7:00 for breakfast,

143
00:05:22,480 --> 00:05:23,680
and leave at 7:30.

144
00:05:24,320 --> 00:05:25,800
Such a healthy routine.

145
00:05:26,280 --> 00:05:28,280
This is actually our director's routine.

146
00:05:28,280 --> 00:05:29,610
I was influenced by her.

147
00:05:35,240 --> 00:05:36,960
Do you usually eat breakfast?

148
00:05:37,280 --> 00:05:39,320
I never used to eat breakfast before work,

149
00:05:39,320 --> 00:05:41,240
but now, when I wake up, I'll

150
00:05:41,240 --> 00:05:42,900
have a slice of honey oat bread

151
00:05:43,080 --> 00:05:43,940
and a fried egg,

152
00:05:44,080 --> 00:05:45,760
along with a spoonful of Manuka honey.

153
00:05:45,760 --> 00:05:47,420
It's nutritious and healthy.

154
00:05:47,480 --> 00:05:49,159
So, is this habit of eating breakfast

155
00:05:49,159 --> 00:05:51,320
also influenced by Director Ning Jin?

156
00:05:51,320 --> 00:05:51,760
Yes.

157
00:05:52,159 --> 00:05:53,880
The director not only influences my life

158
00:05:53,880 --> 00:05:55,080
but also my work.

159
00:05:59,760 --> 00:06:00,560
Are you okay?

160
00:06:01,160 --> 00:06:01,690
I'm fine.

161
00:06:02,120 --> 00:06:03,560
Sister Hu, your throat is bothering you.

162
00:06:03,560 --> 00:06:04,560
Let me recommend a miracle cure.

163
00:06:04,560 --> 00:06:06,160
Ning Jin told me about it too.

164
00:06:06,320 --> 00:06:08,280
She also gets mentally fatigued

165
00:06:08,280 --> 00:06:09,360
and is prone to allergies,

166
00:06:09,360 --> 00:06:11,220
so her throat always bothers her.

167
00:06:15,840 --> 00:06:17,200
Let's continue.

168
00:06:17,760 --> 00:06:19,680
During your regular rehearsals,

169
00:06:19,680 --> 00:06:21,640
what do you usually do during breaks?

170
00:06:21,640 --> 00:06:22,880
During rehearsal breaks,

171
00:06:22,880 --> 00:06:24,480
I often communicate with the director.

172
00:06:24,480 --> 00:06:25,560
Every time I get home,

173
00:06:25,560 --> 00:06:27,620
I also call her to discuss the script.

174
00:06:28,240 --> 00:06:28,960
You could say

175
00:06:28,960 --> 00:06:30,620
the play A Chinese Ghost Story

176
00:06:30,640 --> 00:06:31,970
is basically our child.

177
00:06:36,560 --> 00:06:37,360
Are you okay?

178
00:06:37,360 --> 00:06:37,760
No, no.

179
00:06:37,760 --> 00:06:39,560
I'll cough my lungs out at this rate.

180
00:06:39,560 --> 00:06:40,760
Let's stop here for today.

181
00:06:40,760 --> 00:06:41,360
Let's go.

182
00:06:41,480 --> 00:06:41,920
Okay.

183
00:06:42,680 --> 00:06:43,040
Um,

184
00:06:43,040 --> 00:06:44,440
let's pause for a moment.

185
00:06:48,159 --> 00:06:49,020
I'm exhausted.

186
00:06:49,840 --> 00:06:50,880
Tell me, Ms. Hu.

187
00:06:51,960 --> 00:06:53,000
We were doing fine recording the podcast,

188
00:06:53,000 --> 00:06:54,440
but you suddenly dragged me away.

189
00:06:54,440 --> 00:06:55,720
Is there some big news?

190
00:06:56,960 --> 00:06:58,360
Please, no more big news.

191
00:06:58,720 --> 00:06:59,980
My heart can't take it.

192
00:07:00,440 --> 00:07:02,280
You should cut down on coffee.

193
00:07:04,320 --> 00:07:05,450
It's not the coffee.

194
00:07:05,760 --> 00:07:06,890
It's because of you.

195
00:07:07,560 --> 00:07:08,360
Because of me?

196
00:07:10,240 --> 00:07:11,640
Is it "Unexpected Life"?

197
00:07:11,960 --> 00:07:13,160
Didn't they already say

198
00:07:13,160 --> 00:07:15,560
the part with Ning Jin and Director Zha will be cut out?

199
00:07:15,560 --> 00:07:17,920
And the director said they wouldn't use it for hype.

200
00:07:17,920 --> 00:07:19,120
There won't be any controversy.

201
00:07:19,120 --> 00:07:19,850
Don't worry.

202
00:07:19,920 --> 00:07:21,320
It's not because of that.

203
00:07:35,960 --> 00:07:37,020
I wanted to ask you,

204
00:07:37,400 --> 00:07:39,440
what's going on between you and Ning Jin?

205
00:07:39,440 --> 00:07:41,159
Nothing is going on between Ning Jin and me.

206
00:07:41,159 --> 00:07:43,680
You two have been in touch so frequently lately,

207
00:07:43,680 --> 00:07:45,480
and you even wrote a song for her.

208
00:07:45,800 --> 00:07:46,440
Plus,

209
00:07:46,920 --> 00:07:49,560
you insisted on inviting her to that variety show.

210
00:07:49,560 --> 00:07:51,480
Weren't you the one who wanted to take her?

211
00:07:51,480 --> 00:07:52,740
How could this happen?

212
00:07:52,760 --> 00:07:54,320
I was completely blind.

213
00:07:54,320 --> 00:07:56,380
How did I only find out about this now?

214
00:07:57,320 --> 00:07:58,380
Fored is not Eason.

215
00:07:58,840 --> 00:08:01,080
Why don't I understand what Sister Hu is talking about?

216
00:08:01,080 --> 00:08:01,640
No, bro.

217
00:08:02,360 --> 00:08:02,640
You.

218
00:08:10,560 --> 00:08:11,080
Jinxi.

219
00:08:11,720 --> 00:08:14,080
Even though we have fallen before,

220
00:08:14,080 --> 00:08:15,320
we shouldn't just fall somewhere

221
00:08:15,320 --> 00:08:17,440
and dig a hole to bury ourselves in.

222
00:08:17,760 --> 00:08:18,760
About the matter between you and Ning Jin,

223
00:08:18,760 --> 00:08:20,480
although not many people know,

224
00:08:20,480 --> 00:08:21,920
the nature of this matter

225
00:08:21,920 --> 00:08:24,240
is already very, very bad.

226
00:08:25,560 --> 00:08:26,160
Sister Hu.

227
00:08:26,720 --> 00:08:29,320
I really don't know what you're talking about.

228
00:08:30,120 --> 00:08:31,640
The fact that you knew to hide it from me

229
00:08:31,640 --> 00:08:33,570
shows your brain isn't broken yet.

230
00:08:33,960 --> 00:08:35,360
I contacted Ning Jin

231
00:08:35,360 --> 00:08:37,679
to create a better work.

232
00:08:37,679 --> 00:08:39,360
Stop creating.

233
00:08:39,360 --> 00:08:42,159
My head hurts just hearing that word.

234
00:08:42,720 --> 00:08:43,720
Let me tell you.

235
00:08:43,720 --> 00:08:44,680
From today on,

236
00:08:44,680 --> 00:08:47,680
you can't have any private contact with Ning Jin.

237
00:08:47,680 --> 00:08:49,280
And you definitely can't go to her house.

238
00:08:49,280 --> 00:08:50,880
How did you know I went there?

239
00:08:56,080 --> 00:08:58,080
I don't know anything.

240
00:08:58,760 --> 00:08:59,760
I'm leaving, bro.

241
00:09:02,080 --> 00:09:02,760
Alright.

242
00:09:04,280 --> 00:09:05,340
About this matter,

243
00:09:06,000 --> 00:09:08,130
just pretend you don't know anything.

244
00:09:08,160 --> 00:09:09,080
Leave the rest

245
00:09:10,240 --> 00:09:10,960
to me.

246
00:09:11,560 --> 00:09:12,480
Leave it to you?

247
00:09:13,000 --> 00:09:13,400
No,

248
00:09:13,400 --> 00:09:14,000
Sister Hu.

249
00:09:15,320 --> 00:09:15,920
Sister Hu.

250
00:09:16,400 --> 00:09:17,560
Sister Hu, don't leave.

251
00:09:17,560 --> 00:09:17,880
You,

252
00:09:19,040 --> 00:09:21,170
aren't you going to drink your coffee?

253
00:09:54,160 --> 00:09:54,920
Great.

254
00:09:55,560 --> 00:09:56,280
This song

255
00:09:56,840 --> 00:10:00,240
must be arranged as the opening of the workshop performance.

256
00:10:00,840 --> 00:10:04,100
The workshop performance isn't even finalized yet, is it?

257
00:10:04,280 --> 00:10:05,240
Of course it is.

258
00:10:05,560 --> 00:10:06,280
The time is set.

259
00:10:06,280 --> 00:10:07,680
I've invited the people.

260
00:10:13,960 --> 00:10:15,920
He manages his figure quite well.

261
00:10:18,320 --> 00:10:19,880
Why don't you watch your own actor,

262
00:10:19,880 --> 00:10:22,540
instead of staring at our director all the time?

263
00:10:24,040 --> 00:10:26,170
You still don't know anything, do you?

264
00:10:28,760 --> 00:10:30,420
It's good that you don't know.

265
00:10:33,160 --> 00:10:36,720
Where does that Ning Jin live?

266
00:10:37,880 --> 00:10:39,210
What are you going to do?

267
00:10:43,560 --> 00:10:45,120
Looking pretty energetic.

268
00:10:48,040 --> 00:10:50,640
By the way, when are you going to tell everyone?

269
00:10:53,160 --> 00:10:56,290
Let's wait until Jinzi finishes giving birth smoothly,

270
00:10:56,360 --> 00:10:57,040
or

271
00:10:58,440 --> 00:10:59,640
after the audition.

272
00:11:03,160 --> 00:11:04,220
What's that sound?

273
00:11:11,920 --> 00:11:13,240
It's Hu.

274
00:11:13,240 --> 00:11:14,160
Who?

275
00:11:14,160 --> 00:11:16,040
Hu.

276
00:11:17,240 --> 00:11:18,700
Does she know you're here?

277
00:11:18,960 --> 00:11:19,960
I didn't tell her.

278
00:11:20,080 --> 00:11:21,760
How did she get my address?

279
00:11:21,760 --> 00:11:23,320
I don't know how she knows.

280
00:11:23,840 --> 00:11:25,080
It must be Eason again.

281
00:11:25,080 --> 00:11:25,440
Get up quickly.

282
00:11:25,440 --> 00:11:26,120
Hide.

283
00:11:27,960 --> 00:11:29,040
Don't go there.

284
00:11:29,320 --> 00:11:30,320
Go to the bedroom.

285
00:11:30,720 --> 00:11:31,680
The bedroom.

286
00:11:32,160 --> 00:11:33,290
Take Jinzi with you.

287
00:11:34,040 --> 00:11:34,880
Over there.

288
00:11:44,120 --> 00:11:45,120
Hu.

289
00:11:46,400 --> 00:11:47,400
Eason is here too.

290
